+  @doc """
+  Runs `fun` inside one transaction that holds the row locks of `keys` (`SELECT ... FOR UPDATE`): `fun.(stored)` gets the stored `%{key => value}` as they are at
+  that moment, and a `save_config_audited/2` called inside it joins the same transaction, so a concurrent save of the same key waits and then sees the new
